  "id": "USN-8717-1",
  "summary": "tika vulnerability",
  "details": "It was discovered that Apache Tika's ISA-Tab parser incorrectly handled\nfile path resolution. An attacker who could place files in a directory that\nTika subsequently parses could use this issue to read arbitrary files \naccessible to the Tika process and have their contents emitted into the \nextracted text output.",
